#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:171
msgid "FAQ(s)"
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:176
msgid "How can we submit a review to a group using this plugin?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:180
msgid ""
"When visiting the \"/groups\" section in the site, go for single group view "
"page, there you can see a menu namely, \"Reviews\" that will allow you if you "
"are a site member to add group review."
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:189
msgid "How to allow users to give multiple reviews on the same group?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:193
msgid ""
"A new functionality \"Multiple Review\" is added to this version of the "
"plugin. In general settings, you can enable or disable it."
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:202
msgid ""
"If I don't want to provide review functionality to any group, then what will I "
"do?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:206
msgid ""
"If you don't want to provide review functionality to any group, you can "
"exclude that group for this functionality. For exclude, the plugin has option "
"to exclude groups in the General tab. Here, you exclude one or more groups "
"from reviews."
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:215
msgid "How to hide some rating criteria from Review form?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:219
msgid "You can hide criteria by disable criteria in 'Criteria' tab."
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:228
msgid ""
"How change label of 'Reviews' tab or label of 'Reviews' sub-tab under 'Manage' "
"tab?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:232
msgid ""
"This plugin provides settings to change labels, you can see settings in "
"plugin's settings 'Display' tab."
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:241
msgid "Why 'Add Review' option is not displaying in a group created by me?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:245
msgid ""
"This option is not displaying because group admin can't review own group, you "
"can add the review to only that groups in which you are not the admin."
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:254
msgid ""
"How to display groups average reviews according to reviews or ratings in "
"sidebar or footer?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:258
msgid ""
"This plugin provides a widget to show average ratings or reviews of BuddyPress "
"Groups, you can use it for display average rating & reviews."
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:267
msgid "Can I use the review form on any other page?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:271
msgid ""
"Yes, you can use the review form on other page, just copy shortcode from "
"review setting page and paste it on the other page."
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:279
msgid "How to show only star rating in Group header?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:283
msgid ""
"If you want to remove additional rating details in group header, you can use "
"'bgr_filter_group_header_rating_details' filter."
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:304
msgid "Where do I ask for support?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:309
#, php-format
msgid "Please visit %1$s for any query related to plugin and BuddyPress."
