#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:364
msgid "Enable auto approval of Reviews"
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:376
msgid ""
"Enable this option, if you want to have the reviews automatically approved, "
"else manual approval will be required."
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:382
msgid "Reviews show at most"
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:387
msgid ""
"This option lets you limit number of reviews in \"Group Reviews\" page & "
"\"Manage Reviews\" Page."
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:391
msgid "Enable BuddyPress notifications"
msgstr ""

#: admin/review-admin-options-page.php:403
msgid ""
"Enable this option, if you want to group admin & reviewer receive notification "
